{"page":214,"width":1795,"height":2912,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"268","words":[{"text":"268","x":196,"y":160,"width":62,"height":30}]},{"text":"Chapter 5 CPU 스케줄링","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":336,"y":162,"width":133,"height":31},{"text":"5","x":485,"y":163,"width":23,"height":24},{"text":"CPU","x":541,"y":164,"width":60,"height":26},{"text":"스케줄링","x":611,"y":162,"width":101,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 시간 할당량 만료 봉쇄 없이 시간 할당량 전부를 시용한 스레드의 새로운 우선하","words":[{"text":"•","x":357,"y":314,"width":15,"height":16},{"text":"시간","x":400,"y":302,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"할당량","x":485,"y":303,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"만료","x":605,"y":303,"width":79,"height":39},{"text":"봉쇄","x":699,"y":302,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"없이","x":787,"y":302,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"시간","x":870,"y":302,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"할당량","x":954,"y":302,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"전부를","x":1077,"y":302,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"시용한","x":1198,"y":302,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"스레드의","x":1323,"y":302,"width":150,"height":41},{"text":"새로운","x":1492,"y":303,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"우선하","x":1619,"y":304,"width":121,"height":58}]},{"text":"이러한 스레드는 CPU 중심 스레드로 간주한다. 테이블에 보인 것처럼 이 스레드틀","words":[{"text":"이러한","x":399,"y":368,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"스레드는","x":518,"y":370,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"CPU","x":675,"y":372,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"중심","x":776,"y":368,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"스레드로","x":862,"y":369,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"간주한다.","x":1019,"y":368,"width":151,"height":40},{"text":"테이블에","x":1190,"y":368,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"보인","x":1353,"y":368,"width":74,"height":40},{"text":"것처럼","x":1448,"y":368,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"이","x":1579,"y":369,"width":30,"height":42},{"text":"스레드틀","x":1627,"y":373,"width":119,"height":54}]},{"text":"은 우선순위가 낮아진다.","words":[{"text":"은","x":394,"y":434,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"우선순위가","x":442,"y":434,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"낮아진다.","x":637,"y":434,"width":149,"height":40}]},{"text":"• 수면 상태로부터 복귀. 입출력 대기와 같은 수면 상태로부터 복귀한 스레드의 우선","words":[{"text":"•","x":347,"y":521,"width":16,"height":16},{"text":"수면","x":391,"y":510,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"상태로부터","x":478,"y":510,"width":177,"height":41},{"text":"복귀.","x":675,"y":511,"width":79,"height":40},{"text":"입출력","x":775,"y":511,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"대기와","x":896,"y":511,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"같은","x":1019,"y":510,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"수면","x":1105,"y":511,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"상태로부터","x":1194,"y":512,"width":184,"height":40},{"text":"복귀한","x":1400,"y":512,"width":118,"height":40},{"text":"스레드의","x":1533,"y":513,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"우선","x":1690,"y":519,"width":53,"height":49}]},{"text":"순위. 테이블이 설명히는 것처럼 대기 중인 스레드가 원하는 입출력 데이터가 가용","words":[{"text":"순위.","x":389,"y":576,"width":80,"height":39},{"text":"테이블이","x":489,"y":576,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"설명히는","x":649,"y":577,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"것처럼","x":808,"y":577,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"대기","x":930,"y":576,"width":65,"height":41},{"text":"중인","x":1016,"y":577,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"스레드가","x":1104,"y":576,"width":147,"height":42},{"text":"원하는","x":1268,"y":577,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"입출력","x":1401,"y":578,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"데이터가","x":1534,"y":578,"width":143,"height":41},{"text":"가용","x":1691,"y":584,"width":52,"height":46}]},{"text":"한 경우 스레드의 우선순위는 50에서 59 사이의 값으로 상승한다. 따라서 대화형 프","words":[{"text":"한","x":387,"y":641,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"경우","x":439,"y":642,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"스레드의","x":523,"y":643,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위는","x":679,"y":643,"width":180,"height":40},{"text":"50에서","x":870,"y":642,"width":110,"height":42},{"text":"59","x":996,"y":648,"width":41,"height":31},{"text":"사이의","x":1052,"y":643,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"값으로","x":1175,"y":644,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"상승한다.","x":1299,"y":644,"widt