580,"y":913,"width":156,"height":47}]},{"text":"제한된 주기 내에 시스템으로부터 응답을 보장받도록 한다. 그러나 일반적으로 실시간","words":[{"text":"제한된","x":314,"y":977,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"주기","x":441,"y":979,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"내에","x":532,"y":979,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"시스템으로부터","x":620,"y":978,"width":242,"height":41},{"text":"응답을","x":883,"y":980,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"보장받도록","x":1008,"y":981,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":1208,"y":982,"width":81,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":1310,"y":982,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1447,"y":982,"width":187,"height":40},{"text":"실시간","x":1651,"y":980,"width":84,"height":45}]},{"text":"클래스에 속하는 프로세스는 소수이다.","words":[{"text":"클래스에","x":312,"y":1045,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"속하는","x":472,"y":1047,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스는","x":593,"y":1047,"width":178,"height":41},{"text":"소수이다.","x":784,"y":1046,"width":149,"height":41}]},{"text":"는 스케줄러와 페이지 디먼과 같은 커널 스레드를 실행하기 위해 시스템 클","words":[{"text":"는","x":506,"y":1117,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"스케줄러와","x":556,"y":1115,"width":180,"height":41},{"text":"페이지","x":750,"y":1114,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"디먼과","x":872,"y":1114,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"같은","x":994,"y":1115,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"커널","x":1083,"y":1115,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"스레드를","x":1169,"y":1117,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"실행하기","x":1335,"y":1116,"width":148,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":1506,"y":1117,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":1598,"y":1115,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"클","x":1707,"y":1119,"width":26,"height":39}]},{"text":"Solaris","words":[{"text":"Solaris","x":381,"y":1117,"width":123,"height":33}]},{"text":"래스를 久卜우한다. 일단 시스템 스레드의 우선순위는 한 번 설정되면 바뀌지 않는다. 시스","words":[{"text":"래스를","x":313,"y":1181,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"久卜우한다.","x":434,"y":1181,"width":152,"height":43},{"text":"일단","x":604,"y":1184,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"시스템","x":686,"y":1184,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":